{
  "comment": [
    "JNI callbacks and resources of java.desktop (libawt / libfontmanager) for GraalVM native images.",
    "JDK version bound: verified with GraalVM for JDK 25 (25.3.4.1).",
    "sun.font.Font2D uses charToGlyphRaw/charToVariationGlyphRaw on JDK 25; JDK 21 only has charToGlyph/charToVariationGlyph.",
    "The ICU data glob keeps the version segment as '*' because it changes per JDK (icudt72b on 21, icudt76b on 25).",
    "Reached only when font measurement / column auto sizing (POI SheetUtil.autoSizeColumn) runs;",
    "beangle-transfer's ExcelWriter sets column widths manually and never triggers it.",
    "Re-verify (javap sun.font.Font2D, jimage list | grep icudt) on every JDK or GraalVM upgrade."
  ],
